Palm's Exhibition (com.palm.app.exhibitionpreferences 1.0.0), as shipped on HP webOS 3.x.

Copyright Palm, Inc. / Hewlett-Packard. Never released under an open licence; distributed by
Lunacy as abandonware, like Mojo, the Prelude fonts and the TouchPad wallpapers: no owner has
asserted rights since webOS was discontinued.

Copied from the reference TouchPad's /usr/palm/applications. The app is here as it was packaged,
but for one image, as on webOS CE: images/appcatalog.png, the "Find more" row's HP shopping bag,
is the webOS App Catalog's icon, the same file as the CE project's system/ (webos-doctor-ce
67ad3d8). It lists the apps that support
Exhibition Mode and starts it; Lunacy's shell draws the Exhibition clock itself, as
LunaSysMgr did (see "Exhibition" in docs/architecture.md).
